# Real indexes this lane measures against. Regenerable by running the indexer,
# never committed.
#
#   _data/          the pre-merge corpus, kept only for before/after diffs
#   _data2/         the re-indexed backbencher-brain corpus
#   _data2_poly/    the eight re-indexed repositories from the first matrix
#   _data_lang/     the second language matrix (Solidity, Go, Python, Rust,
#                   Haskell, Lua, CUE, Haxe, PureScript, Starlark, Jsonnet, V)
#
# The list is a GLOB rather than an enumeration because an enumeration is what
# let `_data_lang` get committed: a new data dir was added, the ignore file named
# the old ones, and 2.3 GB of SQLite went into a commit. Anything that looks like
# an index is ignored by default, which is the direction that fails safely.
_data*/

# Harness output and scratch.
out/
*.log
!harness/*.log
